      "en": "___ worry, everything is fine.",
      "options": [
        "Not",
        "Don't",
        "No"
      ],
      "answer": "Don't",
      "ru": "Не волнуйся, всё в порядке."
    },
    {
      "type": "choose",
      "en": "It's late. ___ go home.",
      "options": [
        "Let's",
        "Let",
        "We"
      ],
      "answer": "Let's",
      "ru": "Уже поздно. Пойдёмте домой."
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "en": "___ straight on and turn right.",
      "answer": "Go",
